{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"agent_message","text":"The flow now starts with an authenticated POST, and the callback stores the returned token without inventing an expiry. I also added a reconnect identity check and clear the credential when Intervals returns 401. I’m verifying the full local flow with a fake Intervals response, since this workspace has no live OAuth credentials."}}
